msgid ""
"\n"
"                    This Privacy Policy explains how English Grows "
"collects,\n"
"                    uses, protects and shares personal information, and how\n"
"                    you can exercise your data protection rights.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    Aquesta Política de privacitat explica com English Grows "
"recull,\n"
"                    utilitza, protegeix i comparteix informació personal, i com\n"
"                    podeu exercir els vostres drets de protecció de dades.\n"
"                "

#: .\home\templates\home\privacy_policy.html:29
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    English Grows uses only strictly necessary cookies.\n"
"                    We do not use cookies for website analytics, "
"advertising\n"
"                    or behavioural tracking.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"                    English Grows utilitza únicament galetes estrictament necessàries.\n"
"                    No utilitzem galetes per a analítica web, publicitat\n"
"                    ni seguiment del comportament.\n"
"                "

