"                    circumstances, transfers may rely on an adequacy\n"
"                    decision, including the EU–US Data Privacy\n"
"                    Framework where applicable, or on appropriate\n"
"                    safeguards such as the European Commission's\n"
"                    Standard Contractual Clauses.\n"
"                "
msgstr ""
