msgstr "Restabliment de la contrasenya"

#: .\templates\account\password_reset_done.html:14
msgid ""
"We have sent you an e-mail. If you have not received it please check your "
"spam folder. Otherwise contact us if you do not receive it in a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Us hem enviat un correu electrònic. Si no l'heu rebut, comproveu la carpeta "
"de correu brossa. Si no el rebeu al cap d'uns minuts, poseu-vos en contacte "
"amb nosaltres."

#: .\templates\account\password_reset_from_key.html:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The password reset link was invalid, possibly because it has already been "
"used.  Please request a <a href=\"%(passwd_reset_url)s\">new password reset</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"L'enllaç per restablir la contrasenya no era vàlid, possiblement perquè ja "
"s'havia utilitzat. Sol·liciteu un <a href=\"%(passwd_reset_url)s\">nou "
"restabliment de contrasenya</a>."

#: .\templates\account\password_reset_from_key.html:16
msgid "change password"
msgstr "canvia la contrasenya"

#: .\templates\account\password_reset_from_key_done.html:8
msgid "Your password is now changed."
msgstr "La vostra contrasenya s'ha canviat."

#: .\templates\account\password_set.html:6
msgid "Set your password"
msgstr "Configureu la vostra contrasenya"

#: .\templates\account\password_set.html:13
msgid "Set Password"
msgstr "Configura la contrasenya"

#: .\templates\account\signup.html:6
msgid "Create your account"
msgstr "Creeu el vostre compte"

#: .\templates\account\signup.html:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"English Grows processes your personal information to create and manage your "
"account. Learn more about how your data is used and your rights in our <a "
"href=\"%(policy_url)s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\">Privacy Policy</a>."
msgstr ""
"English Grows tracta la vostra informació personal per crear i gestionar el "
"vostre compte. Trobareu més informació sobre com s'utilitzen les vostres "
"dades i sobre els vostres drets a la nostra <a href=\"%(policy_url)s\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Política de privacitat</a>."

#: .\templates\account\signup.html:31
msgid "Sign Up"
msgstr "Registra't"

#: .\templates\account\signup.html:34
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Already have an account? Then please <a href=\"%(login_url)s\">log in</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ja teniu un compte? Aleshores, <a href=\"%(login_url)s\">inicieu la sessió</a>."

#: .\templates\account\signup_closed.html:5
msgid "Sign Up Closed"
msgstr "Registre tancat"

#: .\templates\account\signup_closed.html:9
msgid "We are sorry, but the sign up is currently closed."
msgstr "Ho sentim, però actualment el registre està tancat."

#: .\templates\account\verification_sent.html:5
#: .\templates\account\verified_email_required.html:5
msgid "Verify Your E-mail Address"
msgstr "Verifiqueu la vostra adreça de correu electrònic"

#: .\templates\account\verification_sent.html:9
msgid ""
"We have sent an e-mail to you for verification. Follow the link provided to "
"finalize the signup process. If you do not see the verification e-mail in "
"your main inbox, check your spam folder. Please contact us if you do not "
"receive the verification e-mail within a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Us hem enviat un correu electrònic de verificació. Seguiu l'enllaç que hi "
"trobareu per completar el procés de registre. Si no veieu el correu de "
"verificació a la safata d'entrada principal, comproveu la carpeta de correu "
"brossa. Poseu-vos en contacte amb nosaltres si no rebeu el correu de "
"verificació al cap d'uns minuts."

#: .\templates\account\verified_email_required.html:11
msgid ""
"This part of the site requires us to verify that\n"
"you are who you claim to be. For this purpose, we require that you\n"
"verify ownership of your e-mail address. "
msgstr ""
"Aquesta part del lloc web requereix que verifiquem que\n"
"realment sou qui indiqueu ser. Per aquest motiu, cal que\n"
"verifiqueu que sou titular de la vostra adreça de correu electrònic. "

#: .\templates\account\verified_email_required.html:15
msgid ""
"We have sent an e-mail to you for\n"
"verification. Please click on the link inside that e-mail. If you do not see "
"the verification e-mail in your main inbox, check your spam folder. "
"Otherwise\n"
"contact us if you do not receive it within a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"S'acaba d'enviar un correu electrònic de\n"
"verificació. Feu clic a l'enllaç que hi ha dins del correu. Si no veieu el "
"correu de verificació a la safata d'entrada principal, comproveu la carpeta "
"de correu brossa. Si no el rebeu\n"
"al cap d'uns minuts, poseu-vos en contacte amb nosaltres."

#: .\templates\account\verified_email_required.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> you can still <a href=\"%(email_url)s\">change your e-"
"mail address</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Nota:</strong> encara podeu <a href=\"%(email_url)s\">canviar la "
"vostra adreça de correu electrònic</a>."

